failure.message:
org.opentest4j.AssertionFailedError: server copy of arc/farmer/breed_animal.json must match the preset ==> expected: <{
  "holder": {
    "type": "jobsplus:job",
    "id": "tcth:farmer"
  },
  "type": "arc:on_breed_animal",
  "rewards": [
    {
      "type": "jobsplus:job_exp",
      "chance": 100,
      "min": 3,
      "max": 5
    }
  ]
}
> but was: <{
  "holder": {
    "type": "jobsplus:job",
    "id": "tcth:farmer"
  },
  "type": "arc:on_breed_animal",
  "rewards": [
    {
      "type": "jobsplus:job_exp",
      "chance": 100,
      "min": 3,
      "max": 5
    }
  ]
}
>

